      "message": "This asserts `change_boot` is not called, but only because `boot_order` equals the default above. The ordering the change is about, boot mode applied before `boot_to_type`/`change_boot`, is not asserted anywhere. A case with `boot_order !\u003d default` recording call order (`set_bios_attribute` and `reboot_server` before `change_boot`, with the 600s sleep patched out) would cover the regression path.",
